{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44671","headline":"奉和窦使君同恭法师咏高僧二首 竺佛图澄 · 慧宣","name":"奉和窦使君同恭法师咏高僧二首 竺佛图澄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大誓悯涂炭，乘机入生死。\n中州法既弘，葛陂暴亦止。\n乳孔光一室，掌镜彻千里。\n道盛咒莲华，灾生吟棘子。\n埋石缘虽谢，流沙化方始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}